    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i'll call the doctor in the morning but it's 2am and i'm literally in tears from the pain. i've taken advil my whole life and it's always been fine. i just need to get through the night. is there any reason ibuprofen specifically would be bad this early on? like is it really that risky just for one dose?",
